DESCRIPTION:Category: Climbing\nOver the course of 3 classes\, learn critical techniques like heel and toe hooks\, flagging\, body tension\, compression\, deadpoints\, and sequencing. Through drills and direct coaching you’ll learn to bring new purpose and awareness to your climbing to overcome that V5 plateau.\nhttps://portal.movementgyms.com/portland/programs/intermediate-technique-series?course=U2Vzc2lvbjoxMDA1MjU1MTc=&date=2026-11-18
