DESCRIPTION:Category: Climbing\nGive structure to your climbing training! Pyramid training is a great way to get a workout in a short period of time\, is adaptable to many types of climbing\, and is appropriate for all skill levels whether it be V2 or 5.13. In this 30-minute clinic you will practice and learn how to develop a pyramid training routine to incorporate into your training routine.\nhttps://portal.movementgyms.com/portland/programs/climbing-clinic-2?course=U2Vzc2lvbjoxMDA1MjY2NDg=&date=2026-09-17
